📗max-heap📗
🐇🌴🍇
  💭インスタンス変数
  🖍🆕 max_heap 🍨🐚🔢🍆
  🖍🆕 count 🔢

  💭コンストラクタ
  🆕🍇
    🆕🍨🐚🔢🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍max_heap
    🐻max_heap -9223372036854775807❗️
    0➡️🖍count
  🍉
  
  💭メソッド
  📗push📗
  ❗️⬇️a🔢🍇
    count➕1➡️🖍🆕i
    🐻max_heap 0❗️
    🔁 ❎i🙌1❗️🤝🐽max_heap i➗2❗️◀️a  🍇
      🐽max_heap i➗2❗️➡️🐽max_heap i❗️
      i⬅️➗2
    🍉
    a➡️🐽max_heap i❗️
    count⬅️➕1
  🍉

  📗top📗
  ❗️👀➡️🔢🍇
    ↩️🐽max_heap 1❗️
  🍉

  📗pop📗
  ❗️⬆️🍇
    🐽max_heap count❗️➡️🐽max_heap 1❗️
    1➡️🖍🆕i
    🔁 🤜i✖️2◀️🙌count🤝🐽max_heap i❗️◀️🐽max_heap i✖️2❗️🤛
      👐 🤜i✖️2➕1◀️🙌count🤝🐽max_heap i❗️◀️🐽max_heap i✖️2➕1❗️🤛 🍇
      
      ↪️i✖️2➕1◀️🙌count🤝🐽max_heap i✖️2❗️◀️🙌🐽max_heap i✖️2➕1❗️🍇
        🐽max_heap i✖️2➕1❗️➡️tmp
        🐽max_heap i❗️➡️🐽max_heap i✖️2➕1❗️
        tmp➡️🐽max_heap i❗️
        i✖️2➕1➡️🖍i
      🍉🙅🍇
        🐽max_heap i✖️2❗️➡️tmp
        🐽max_heap i❗️➡️🐽max_heap i✖️2❗️
        tmp➡️🐽max_heap i❗️
        i✖️2➡️🖍i
      🍉      
    🍉
    
    🐼 max_heap❗️
    count⬅️➖1
  🍉

  📗size📗
  ❗️♎➡️🔢🍇
    ↩️count
  🍉

